<title>HONG KONG: Leading Spirit 1995/96 net up 32.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Leading Spirit 1995/96 net up 32.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   38.0     vs 32.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    9.0	vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    205.09   vs 155.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,411.19 vs 2,208.04</p>
<p>    Company name		 Leading Spirit (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 20-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Leading Spirit trades components for television sets and audio products. It proposed a bonus issue of three-for-one share held.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted on the assumption of the bonus issue of shares during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 18 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of six cents and the first half special cash dividend of three cents) vs 16 cents (including interim dividend and the first half special cash dividend).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
